# The human lane (#83). A PR that touches any path below needs an Approve from
# the other dev before it can merge; every other PR is in the fast lane and
# needs none. See AGENTS.md §3.7.
#
# Both devs are listed on every line so the rule is symmetric: GitHub never
# counts an author's own approval, so the approval has to come from the other
# one. GitHub reads this file from the PR's base branch, so a PR cannot take
# itself out of the lane by editing it.
#
# scripts/protection.mjs reads this file too, and accepts only anchored paths:
# `/file` or `/folder/`. No wildcards, so both readers agree on what matches.

